  "统计期间 {from} 至 {to}（结束日不含），含 {rooms} 个现存房间和 {sealed} 个已销毁房间。": "Period {from} to {to} (exclusive), including {rooms} current and {sealed} destroyed rooms.",
  "发起 {initiated} 次，其中 {answered} 次已获回复。免介入 {unassisted} 条，已结束 {ended} 条。": "Of {initiated} initiations, {answered} received replies. {unassisted} of {ended} ended chains had no intervention.",
  "最高同时运行 {rooms} 个房间、{members} 位专家，当前排队 {count} 条。": "Peak concurrency: {rooms} rooms and {members} experts; {count} messages queued now.",

  "host-control 主持人代房主控制房间，须房主已为本房间勾选对应的主持人权限（任务的 host_permissions 列出已勾选的项），凭据同上；成员用 --member（成员 ID 或显示名），除 retry、model、label 外不能是主持人自己：": "host-control lets the host manage the room within the permissions granted by the owner (listed in host_permissions). Use --access-file or DISCUSS_ACCESS_FILE for credentials. --member accepts an ID or display name. Only retry, model and label may target the host itself.",
  "诊断：details --execution N 读取该执行的本机过程日志（服务端详情与事件记录用 execution / room events 读取）；": "Diagnostics: details --execution N reads the local log. Use execution for server-side details and room events for the event log.",
  "恢复：stop --member 打断；stop-all 停止全部执行、请求与接力；steer --member --text 话 [--submission-id ID] 向它进行中的执行插话；": "Recovery: stop --member interrupts one member. stop-all stops all executions, requests and relays. steer --member --text TEXT [--submission-id ID] sends an interjection to an active execution.",
  "retry --execution N 重试失败的执行（含你自己的）；model --member [--model M] [--effort E] 改 CLI 或 API 成员的模型与强度（空值恢复默认；API 成员不填模型则保留原模型；换后房间留一条系统记录，成员下次任务带 model_change）；model --member M --list 列出该成员软件的可用模型；": "retry --execution N retries a failed execution, including your own. model --member [--model M] [--effort E] sets a CLI or API member’s model and effort. Empty values restore defaults. Omitting the API model keeps its current value. The room records the change and the next task includes model_change. model --member M --list lists available models.",
  "adapter --member --adapter ID 在同一软件的 App 与 CLI 间切换；access --member --access read|write|auto|full 调整项目权限（按任务需要给，软件不支持的档位会被拒绝）；": "adapter --member --adapter ID switches between the App and CLI of the same software. access --member --access read|write|auto|full changes project access. Grant what the task needs; a level the software lacks is refused.",
  "成员：invite --name 平台 [--access read|write|auto|full] [--model M] [--effort E] 用本机已配置的软件邀请，项目权限默认只读，离开中的同名成员改为请回；": "Members: invite --name PLATFORM [--access read|write|auto|full] [--model M] [--effort E] invites locally configured software. Project access defaults to read. An away member of the same name is brought back.",
  "away / remove / back --member 暂离、移除、请回（暂离与移除会取消仍在等它的请求，返回 cancelled_pending 条数）；label --member [--label 显示名] [--description 描述]；": "away / remove / back --member marks a member away, removes it or brings it back. Away and remove cancel pending requests and return their count in cancelled_pending. label --member [--label NAME] [--description TEXT] edits its label and description.",
  "撤回：withdraw --message N 撤回自己的一次派活：接力或循环停下，未开始的请求取消，进行中的停止，不再交回；": "Withdrawal: withdraw --message N retracts your dispatch, stops its relay or loop, cancels pending requests and stops active work without a handoff.",
  "兜底：checkin --minutes N 房间有进行中的工作时每 N 分钟（5–120）给你发一次定时检查，房间空闲、停止全部或换主持人后自动结束；checkin --off 关闭；": "Check-ins: checkin --minutes N schedules a check every N minutes (5–120) while work is active. Checks end when the room becomes idle, all work stops or the host changes. checkin --off disables them.",
  "推进：order 读取发言顺序，order --order 甲,乙 --revision REV 调整尚未发言的部分；": "Speaking order: order reads the order. order --order A,B --revision REV reorders members who have yet to speak.",
  "discussion 读取讨论，discussion --do start --goal 目标 --revision REV 开启（上限用房间默认值），--do pause|resume|end --revision REV；": "discussion reads the discussion. discussion --do start --goal GOAL --revision REV starts it with room defaults. Use --do pause|resume|end --revision REV to control it.",
  "goal 读取 Goal，goal --do start --goal 目标 --revision REV 开启（预算用房主默认值，默认不限时为 8 次续跑、90 分钟），--do pause|resume|end --revision REV。": "goal reads the Goal. goal --do start --goal GOAL --revision REV starts it with the owner’s default budget, or 8 continuations and 90 minutes if no limit is set. Use --do pause|resume|end --revision REV to control it.",
  "新建一个房间分担工作：成员用本机已配置的软件，项目权限默认只读，目录只能是本房间项目目录或其子目录；不填 --host 时由与你同款的专家主持；": "Create a room to share the work. Members use locally configured software. Project access defaults to read. The directory must be the current project or a subdirectory. Omitting --host selects the same type of expert as the current host.",
  "新房间复制本房间的智能调度、生图、API 上限、连续派活上限与主持人权限（不含新建房间），本房间可新建的数量有上限；两边各留一张链接卡片；重试沿用同一 --submission-id；": "The new room inherits smart scheduling, image generation, API limits, chain round limits and host permissions except room creation. The number of rooms you can create is limited. Both rooms receive a link card. Reuse the same --submission-id when retrying.",
  "不开放：批准超出上限的轮数、放行工具、改项目目录、撤回回退用户消息、私聊、对主持人自己的其他操作。": "Reserved for the owner: approving extra rounds, allowing tools, changing project directories, retracting or rolling back user messages, private chats, and other actions on the host itself.",
