  "AI CoDiscuss CLI\n\n用法：codiscuss [命令] [选项]\n\n  （无命令）            在当前终端启动服务，Ctrl+C 停止\n  install / setup       安装持久命令并配置 / 配置已有安装\n  local COMMAND         管理本机网站，或 connect 连接线上站点\n  token                 生成线上网站的一次性管理员注册令牌\n  panel [open|start|stop]  打开本机管理面板（托管用户、命令行登录、API 密钥）\n  admin COMMAND         以命令行完成管理面板的全部操作（启动、退出、更新、托管账号等）\n  launcher              生成“共议.exe”与桌面、开始菜单快捷方式，双击即可启动（Windows）\n  service COMMAND       启动、停止、查询服务，或登记房间\n  launch COMMAND        保存启动配置，或从 AI 对话启动讨论\n  room COMMAND          创建、读取或更新讨论房间\n  message COMMAND       检索原文、提交观点\n  attachment COMMAND    上传、查询与下载讨论附件\n  turn COMMAND          安排发言、读取待办与回答\n  state COMMAND         读取或保存共享状态\n  run COMMAND           配置、启动或暂停网站上的讨论\n  execution COMMAND     进入或查询一次 AI 执行\n  health                检查网站健康状态\n  schema [COMMAND]      离线查看命令与参数\n  api PATH              访问尚未封装的网站接口\n  join LINK|CODE        用本机 AI 加入另一台电脑上的房间（外部成员）\n  invited COMMAND       查看外部房间，调整信任等级、同意或拒绝唤醒、退出\n  repo COMMAND          外部成员只读查看对方电脑开放的项目\n  site COMMAND          预检、发布、续期、回滚或撤销房间静态网站（公开发布须经用户明确授权）\n  share-card COMMAND    读取房间可分享协作指标与素材，或将本地静态 HTML 封面导出为 PNG\n\n  codiscuss service --help\n  codiscuss room --help\n  codiscuss health --site http://127.0.0.1:8765\n\n网站操作使用 --site、DISCUSS_URL 或 --access-file 中的站点，并需要 Python 3.10+。\n原有 start、status、stop、add 等服务命令继续兼容。\n": "AI CoDiscuss CLI\n\nUsage: codiscuss [command] [options]\n\n  (no command)          Run the service in this terminal; Ctrl+C to stop\n  install / setup       Install the persistent command and configure / configure an existing installation\n  local COMMAND         Manage the local site, or connect to an online site\n  token                 Generate a single-use admin registration token for an online site\n  panel [open|start|stop]  Open the local admin panel (hosting, CLI sign-ins, API keys)\n  admin COMMAND         Manage everything in the admin panel from the command line\n  launcher              Create “共议.exe” and desktop / Start menu shortcuts (Windows)\n  service COMMAND       Start, stop or inspect the service, or register a room\n  launch COMMAND        Save launch settings or start a discussion from an AI chat\n  room COMMAND          Create, read or update rooms\n  message COMMAND       Read original messages or submit a reply\n  attachment COMMAND    Upload, inspect or download room attachments\n  turn COMMAND          Schedule turns, read pending work and answer\n  state COMMAND         Read or save shared state\n  run COMMAND           Configure, start or pause discussions on the site\n  execution COMMAND     Enter or inspect an AI run\n  health                Check site health\n  schema [COMMAND]      View commands and arguments offline\n  api PATH              Access site endpoints without a dedicated command\n  join LINK|CODE        Join a room on another computer with this computer's AI (external member)\n  invited COMMAND       List external rooms, set trust levels, approve or refuse wake-ups, leave\n  repo COMMAND          Read the project another computer opened to you (external members)\n  site COMMAND          Stage, publish, renew, rollback or revoke static websites (public publishing requires explicit user authorization)\n  share-card COMMAND    Read shareable room collaboration metrics and materials, or render a local static HTML cover to PNG\n\n  codiscuss service --help\n  codiscuss room --help\n  codiscuss health --site http://127.0.0.1:8765\n\nSite commands use --site, DISCUSS_URL or the site in --access-file, and require Python 3.10+.\nLegacy service commands such as start, status, stop and add remain supported.\n",
  "AI CoDiscuss 讨论服务\n\n用法：codiscuss service [命令] [选项]\n\n  （无命令） / run       在当前终端运行，Ctrl+C 停止\n  start                 在后台启动，已运行时复用\n  status                查看服务与房间状态\n  stop                  暂停托管中的讨论并停止服务\n  add --config FILE     登记房间的私有接入配置\n  remove --config FILE  移除已登记配置\n  list                  列出已登记配置\n  clean                 立即清理无房间使用的启动目录、草稿与超长日志（服务每 6 小时自动清理一次）\n  open                  后台启动并打开讨论网站\n  shortcut              创建 Windows 桌面快捷方式\n  autostart on|off      开启或关闭 Windows 登录自启\n\n  --json                以 JSON 输出命令结果（前台运行除外）\n  -h, --help            显示帮助\n\n登记或启动服务不会自动开始讨论，仍需在网页明确启动。\n": "AI CoDiscuss discussion service\n\nUsage: codiscuss service [command] [options]\n\n  (no command) / run    Run in this terminal; Ctrl+C to stop\n  start                 Start in the background; reuse if already running\n  status                Show service and room status\n  stop                  Pause managed discussions and stop the service\n  add --config FILE     Register a room's private connection configuration\n  remove --config FILE  Remove a registered configuration\n  list                  List registered configurations\n  clean                 Remove unused launch folders, drafts and oversized logs now (also runs every 6 hours)\n  open                  Start in the background and open the discussion site\n  shortcut              Create a Windows desktop shortcut\n  autostart on|off       Enable or disable starting at Windows sign-in\n\n  --json                Output command results as JSON (except foreground runs)\n  -h, --help            Show help\n\nRegistering or starting the service does not start a discussion; start it explicitly on the site.\n",
  "排障速查\n  按标题找房间      codiscuss room list --query \"标题片段\"\n  追踪消息的处理    codiscuss room trace ROOM --message MESSAGE_ID\n  查看执行详情      codiscuss execution view ROOM EXECUTION_ID\n  核对站点版本      codiscuss site diagnose SITE_ID\n": "Troubleshooting\n  Find a room by title      codiscuss room list --query \"part of title\"\n  Trace a message           codiscuss room trace ROOM --message MESSAGE_ID\n  Inspect an execution      codiscuss execution view ROOM EXECUTION_ID\n  Check a deployed version  codiscuss site diagnose SITE_ID\n",
