  "电脑还没连上线上站点：本机服务刚启动时稍等几秒；持续如此，可能这台电脑绑定的站点与入口不属于同一个 Cloudflare 账号，重新用接入码接入": "The computer has not connected to the online site. Wait a few seconds after starting the local service. If this persists, the bound site and entry may belong to different Cloudflare accounts; reconnect with an access code.",
