  "管理面板：http://127.0.0.1:{value1}\n": "Admin panel: http://127.0.0.1:{value1}\n",
  "正在运行的任务栏图标来自旧版本：运行 codiscuss panel stop 后再运行 codiscuss panel open": "The running tray icon is from an older version. Run codiscuss panel stop, then codiscuss panel open.",
  "管理面板已停止\n": "Admin panel stopped\n",
  "用法：codiscuss token [--config WRANGLER_CONFIG]\n\n生成一次性绑定令牌，经 wrangler 把它的哈希写入线上 D1，立即生效。\n在要绑定的电脑上执行 codiscuss local connect 网站地址 --setup-key 令牌；绑定成功即作废，重新运行会替换旧令牌。\n在部署网站的电脑上直接运行 codiscuss local connect 时会自动生成，无须本命令。\n需要这台电脑已 wrangler login；--config 默认为当前目录的 {value1}。网站不设账号和密码。\n": "Usage: codiscuss token [--config WRANGLER_CONFIG]\n\nGenerate a single-use binding token and write its hash to online D1 through wrangler; takes effect immediately.\nOn the computer to bind, run codiscuss local connect SITE --setup-key TOKEN. The token expires after binding; rerunning replaces the old token.\nRunning codiscuss local connect on the deployment computer generates it automatically, without this command.\nThis computer must be signed in with wrangler login. --config defaults to {value1} in the current folder. The site has no accounts or passwords.\n",
  "找不到部署配置 {value1}；请在项目目录运行，或用 --config 指定 wrangler.jsonc": "Deployment config {value1} not found. Run from the project folder or specify wrangler.jsonc with --config.",
  "wrangler 写入线上数据库失败：{value1}": "wrangler failed to write to the online database: {value1}",
  "绑定令牌（一次性）：\n{value1}\n\n在要绑定的电脑上执行 codiscuss local connect 网站地址 --setup-key 令牌。绑定成功后作废。\n": "Binding token (single use):\n{value1}\n\nOn the computer to bind, run codiscuss local connect SITE --setup-key TOKEN. The token expires after binding.\n",
  "用法：codiscuss local open|start|status|stop [--json]\n      codiscuss local connect SITE [--setup-key KEY] [--no-open]\n      codiscuss local disconnect SITE\n\nconnect 把这台电脑绑定到线上网站（只用于外出时中转，网站不存房间、不设账号）：用部署者的一次性绑定令牌登记本机，\n  令牌取自 --setup-key，未给出时在本机经 wrangler 直接生成（须是部署网站的电脑且已 wrangler login）；\n  之后在电脑本机网页“设置 → 账号 → 添加设备”扫码配对外出设备。自托管 Python 站点则打开连接链接完成接入。\ndisconnect 撤销该站点的新启动权限（含其他设备经网站转来的启动）；已运行的讨论须另行暂停。\n数据保留在服务目录中；重新 connect 会替换该站点的旧连接。\n结果摘要写入终端；输出被重定向或加 --json 时 JSON 写入 stdout。\n": "Usage: codiscuss local open|start|status|stop [--json]\n       codiscuss local connect SITE [--setup-key KEY] [--no-open]\n       codiscuss local disconnect SITE\n\nconnect binds this computer to an online site (a remote-access relay; it stores no rooms and has no accounts), using the deployer's single-use binding token.\n  Pass --setup-key, or generate it locally through wrangler (requires the deployment computer, signed in with wrangler login).\n  Then pair remote devices by scanning the code under Settings → Account → Add device on the computer's local site. For a self-hosted Python site, open the connection link instead.\ndisconnect revokes this site's permission to start new work, including requests forwarded from other devices. Pause running discussions separately.\nData stays in the service folder. Connecting again replaces the previous connection for that site.\nA summary is printed to the terminal; JSON goes to stdout when redirected or with --json.\n",
  "连接站点须为 HTTPS 根地址；本机测试可使用 http://127.0.0.1:端口": "The site must be an HTTPS root URL. For local testing, use http://127.0.0.1:PORT.",
  "需要绑定令牌：请在部署网站的电脑上运行 codiscuss token，再执行 codiscuss local connect {value1} --setup-key 令牌（{value2}）": "A binding token is required. Run codiscuss token on the deployment computer, then codiscuss local connect {value1} --setup-key TOKEN ({value2}).",
  "绑定失败：HTTP {value1}": "Binding failed: HTTP {value1}",
  "本机网站启动失败，请查看 local/website.log（可能端口已占用）": "Local site failed to start. Check local/website.log (the port may be in use).",
