  "无法打开浏览器：{value1}；请访问 {value2}\n": "Cannot open the browser: {value1}. Visit {value2}.\n",
  "网站与讨论服务在后台运行，关闭此终端不影响；停止运行 codiscuss local stop": "The site and discussion service run in the background; closing this terminal does not stop them. Run codiscuss local stop to stop.",
  "（已在浏览器打开）": " (opened in browser)",
  "本机网站已就绪：{value1}{value2}": "Local site ready: {value1}{value2}",
  "本机网站已就绪：{value1}（未打开浏览器，可直接访问此地址）": "Local site ready: {value1} (browser not opened; visit this address directly)",
