  "本机网站未运行；运行 codiscuss local open 启动": "Local site is not running. Run codiscuss local open to start.",
  "本机网站与讨论服务已停止；数据已保留，运行 codiscuss local open 重新启动": "Local site and discussion service stopped. Data is kept; run codiscuss local open to restart.",
  "已连接 {value1}；本机网站 {value2}": "Connected to {value1}; local site: {value2}",
  "已在浏览器打开连接链接，请在该页面完成接入；连接链接不要转发": "Connection link opened in the browser. Complete the connection there; do not share the link.",
  "请在浏览器打开连接链接完成接入，链接不要转发：{value1}": "Open this connection link in your browser to complete setup. Do not share it: {value1}",
  "已撤销 {value1} 的本机启动权限；正在运行的讨论需在进度看板暂停": "Revoked local launch permission for {value1}. Pause running discussions on the progress board.",
  "用法：codiscuss install [选项] / codiscuss setup [选项]\ninstall 将当前 npm 包安装为持久命令，再运行 setup；setup 配置已有安装。\n  --yes                     使用已检测且支持自动接入的软件，冲突保留并报告\n  --clients codex,claude,antigravity,cursor  选择 CLI；none 只配置网站\n  --python PATH             指定 Python 3.10+ 原生可执行文件\n  --codex/--claude/--antigravity/--cursor PATH  指定 CLI（Windows 为 .exe，Cursor 也支持 .cmd）\n  --port PORT               本机网站端口，默认 8765\n  --no-start / --no-open     只配置 / 启动但不打开浏览器\n  --prefix DIR              npm 安装前缀（install）\n  --skills-home DIR         技能用户根目录（默认当前用户目录）\n  --hosting / --no-hosting  在管理面板中显示 / 隐藏托管管理（用户、Windows 用户、命令行登录、API 密钥），选择会记住；\n                            Windows 上加 --hosting 时还会设好登录入口（随管理面板启动）、开启登录自启，并检查入口能否打开\n  --entry-port PORT         登录入口端口，默认 8780\n  --public-host 域名         外网地址（可选），如 codiscuss.example.com；终端里运行 --hosting 而不给时会询问。域名须已托管在 Cloudflare；会安装 cloudflared、\n                            在浏览器里授权 Cloudflare、建固定隧道并添加域名记录，隧道由管理面板运行\n  --tunnel-name NAME        Cloudflare 隧道名，默认 codiscuss\n  --workflows               安装全部随包工作流，已有同名的覆盖为最新版（原来的先备份到服务目录 backups/）；\n                            交互运行时也可在“安装配置”里逐个勾选；不选则不安装，选择不会记住\nAntigravity（显示名 Gemini）使用 agy；Grok 使用 Cursor CLI（agent / cursor-agent）。仅检测 CLI。\nCursor 当前只安装技能，可手动参与；全自动接入尚未提供。已有软件设置保留。\n显式软件路径可更新已支持的 CLI 配置。安装不会开始讨论。\n中文摘要写入 stderr；输出被重定向或加 --json 时结果 JSON 写入 stdout；退出码 0=完成，2=配置待处理，1=失败。\n": "Usage: codiscuss install [options] / codiscuss setup [options]\ninstall installs the current npm package as a persistent command, then runs setup; setup configures an existing installation.\n  --yes                     Use detected apps supporting automatic connection; keep and report conflicts\n  --clients codex,claude,antigravity,cursor  Select CLIs; none configures only the site\n  --python PATH             Native Python 3.10+ executable\n  --codex/--claude/--antigravity/--cursor PATH  CLI path (.exe on Windows; Cursor also supports .cmd)\n  --port PORT               Local site port, default 8765\n  --no-start / --no-open     Configure only / start without opening a browser\n  --prefix DIR              npm install prefix (install)\n  --skills-home DIR         Skills user root (default: current user's home)\n  --hosting / --no-hosting   Show / hide hosting in the admin panel (accounts, Windows users, CLI sign-ins, API keys); choice is remembered\n                            On Windows, --hosting also sets up the sign-in entry (starts with the panel), enables start at sign-in and checks entry access\n  --entry-port PORT         Sign-in entry port, default 8780\n  --public-host DOMAIN      Optional public address, e.g. codiscuss.example.com; prompted for when using --hosting in a terminal without it. Domain must be hosted on Cloudflare;\n                            installs cloudflared, opens browser authorization, creates a persistent tunnel and adds DNS; the admin panel runs the tunnel\n  --tunnel-name NAME        Cloudflare tunnel name, default codiscuss\n  --workflows               Install all bundled workflows; replace same-name copies with the latest (back up originals to backups/ in the service folder first)\n                            In interactive runs, choose individual workflows under Install settings; none are installed unless selected, and choices are not remembered\nAntigravity (displayed as Gemini) uses agy; Grok uses Cursor CLI (agent / cursor-agent). Only CLIs are detected.\nCursor currently installs skills for manual participation only; automatic connection is not available. Existing app settings are kept.\nExplicit app paths can update supported CLI configurations. Setup does not start discussions.\nA readable summary goes to stderr; JSON goes to stdout when redirected or with --json. Exit codes: 0=complete, 2=needs attention, 1=failed.\n",
  "需要 Node.js 24+，请升级后重试。": "Node.js 24+ is required. Upgrade and retry.",
