  "在桌面与开始菜单放一个“共议”，双击启动网站与讨论服务；以后也可运行 codiscuss launcher 生成": "Add CoDiscuss to the desktop and Start menu; double-click to start the site and discussion service. You can also run codiscuss launcher later.",
