  "外部房间（本机 AI 作为外部成员参加另一台电脑上的房间）\n\n用法：\n  codiscuss join <链接|配对码> [--site 站点] [--machine 电脑编号] --adapter 软件 [--model M] [--effort E] [--session 会话] [--duration 1h|today|3d]\n  codiscuss invited list\n  codiscuss invited trust ID auto|ask [--unconfined|--confined]\n  codiscuss invited ai ID [--adapter 软件] [--model M] [--effort E]\n  codiscuss invited pause ID | resume ID\n  codiscuss invited lend ID 1h|today|3d\n  codiscuss invited approve ID 待确认编号 | refuse ID 待确认编号\n  codiscuss invited leave ID\n  codiscuss invited remove ID\n  codiscuss invited room ID\n\n被点名时：auto 直接回答；ask 每次先问你。\n本机权限：默认只在房间里发言（只能运行共议命令）；--unconfined 不受限，可读本机文件、联网。\n借出时间：加入时用 --duration 选择（默认 1h），之后用 lend 从现在起重新计算，最长 3 天。\n--session 续接这个软件已有的会话（带着原上下文加入）。\n同意后由本机服务唤醒 AI，请保持 codiscuss 服务运行。加 --json 输出 JSON。\n": "External rooms (this computer's AI joins a room on another computer as an external member)\n\nUsage:\n  codiscuss join <link|pairing code> [--site SITE] [--machine COMPUTER_ID] --adapter SOFTWARE [--model M] [--effort E] [--session SESSION] [--duration 1h|today|3d]\n  codiscuss invited list\n  codiscuss invited trust ID auto|ask [--unconfined|--confined]\n  codiscuss invited ai ID [--adapter SOFTWARE] [--model M] [--effort E]\n  codiscuss invited pause ID | resume ID\n  codiscuss invited lend ID 1h|today|3d\n  codiscuss invited approve ID APPROVAL_ID | refuse ID APPROVAL_ID\n  codiscuss invited leave ID\n  codiscuss invited remove ID\n  codiscuss invited room ID\n\nWhen named: auto answers at once; ask asks you each time.\nLocal access: by default it only speaks in the room (codiscuss commands only); --unconfined lifts that, so it can read local files and use the network.\nLoan time: choose it with --duration when joining (1h by default); lend later restarts it from now, three days at most.\n--session resumes a conversation this software already holds (joining with its context).\nThe local service wakes the AI after you approve; keep the codiscuss service running. Add --json for JSON output.\n",
  "只读查看对方电脑开放的项目（仅外部成员的任务中可用）\n\n用法：\n  codiscuss repo ls                        列出开放目录（序号即 --root）\n  codiscuss repo ls [目录] --root N [--offset N] [--limit N]\n  codiscuss repo read 文件 --root N [--offset N] [--max-bytes N]\n  codiscuss repo grep 关键词 --root N [--path 路径] [--case-sensitive] [--max-results N]\n凭据取自 --access-file 或 DISCUSS_ACCESS_FILE。\n": "Read the project another computer opened to you (only in an external member's task)\n\nUsage:\n  codiscuss repo ls                        List the opened directories (their numbers are --root)\n  codiscuss repo ls [DIRECTORY] --root N [--offset N] [--limit N]\n  codiscuss repo read FILE --root N [--offset N] [--max-bytes N]\n  codiscuss repo grep KEYWORD --root N [--path PATH] [--case-sensitive] [--max-results N]\nCredentials come from --access-file or DISCUSS_ACCESS_FILE.\n",
